(For a start, [http://home.earthlink.net/~bwcarver/ludwig/|Wittgenstein]'s "Philosophical Investigations" might not be inappropriate. When we wonder what it is to express ourselves ''((lobykai))'', and not simply encode our English, we are asking Wittgensteinian questions.)

